{"data": [{"article": {"title": "\u6a21\u578b\u534a\u5e74\u964d\u4ef7\u6700\u591a80%\uff1a\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u4f60\u7684AI\u8d26\u5355\u4e0d\u4e00\u5b9a\u53d8\u5c0f"}, "author_id": "854322761157681153", "created_at": "2026-10-29T18:23:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115872228143415797"], "id": "2115872228143415797", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/UbfxoeODdc", "url": "https://x.com/UnderleveledDev/status/2115872228143415797"}, {"article": {"title": "Tobi L\u00fctke on why Shopify opened its doors to AI shopping agents"}, "author_id": "989918876254294016", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:54:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115864890518753540"], "id": "2115864890518753540", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Shopify's founder swapped wine for GPUs. He thinks AI agents will make shopping, and starting a business, easier. https://t.co/0fhZXBFfpK", "url": "https://x.com/wealthleee/status/2115864890518753540"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115863887614824448", "3_2115863887606333440", "3_2115863887597940736", "3_2115863887656685568"]}, "author_id": "183385598", "created_at": "2026-10-29T17:50:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115863901141344538"], "id": "2115863901141344538", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "tibo got poteto a domain (reportedly $4,988) and built her a whole potato site\nwang got tibo's full-name .com and pointed it at muse. 7.7s redirect\n\n#OpenAI #Codex #xAI #Grok #Meta #Muse https://t.co/GggmoSyPm7", "url": "https://x.com/realmilessun/status/2115863901141344538"}, {"article": {"title": "AI agents in plain English: Grok Bot, OpenAI Dots, Meta Muse and Claude Duet"}, "author_id": "2110473269421719552", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:54:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115849755653763403"], "id": "2115849755653763403", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 263, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/h3SvKCRfN9", "url": "https://x.com/AIWorkflowX/status/2115849755653763403"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115845661211971585"]}, "author_id": "469069988", "created_at": "2026-10-29T16:38:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115845730594156582"], "id": "2115845730594156582", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Personal agents are here, and they're already in checkout flows.\n\nMeta Muse has 10M downloads in 40 days, almost 3x ChatGPT at launch. The #1 use case? shopping.\n\nChatbots cited your page. Agents check out on it.\n\nWant your page agent-readable? Talk to us at @sitefireai! https://t.co/kkqyOMfl7o", "url": "https://x.com/jochenmadler/status/2115845730594156582"}, {"author_id": "2063285148519710720", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:22:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115826547911438447"], "id": "2115826547911438447", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115747212852363548", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "AirOps compared Meta Muse with ChatGPT and Anthropic. Muse cites more sources, uses far fewer words and tables, and skips the follow up question.\n\nSimon Taylor calls it short form built for finishing tasks, not chatting.\n\nLess text and more sources is the product win https://t.co/GwgoeseJMW", "url": "https://x.com/shiparena/status/2115826547911438447"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115821557868015616"]}, "author_id": "2009542791484080128", "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:02:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115821602810040811"], "id": "2115821602810040811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 608, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2107763347097534680", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ANTHROPIC DROPPED CLAUDE DUET: four AI agents now fight to run your day, and this is the one that messages you first\n\nwhile everyone is still testing Grok Bot and Meta Muse, Anthropic shipped the most proactive agent of the four\n\nDuet doesn't wait for you to open the app.\nevery https://t.co/ro0oeIl7jM https://t.co/mXl3ltaMT1", "url": "https://x.com/Capslock404/status/2115821602810040811"}, {"article": {"title": "Ken Griffin says the edge is the story. The funds spending the most on AI seem to agree."}, "author_id": "1594390738472558593", "created_at": "2026-10-29T13:10:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115793439971250528"], "id": "2115793439971250528", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/NBpUDmYyYV", "url": "https://x.com/diegoooguti/status/2115793439971250528"}, {"article": {"title": "Best Android AI Assistants in 2026: 5 Tools Compared"}, "author_id": "2053782809232478208", "created_at": "2026-10-29T12:33:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115784046097965209"], "id": "2115784046097965209", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/tF3p24gNpD", "url": "https://x.com/FoneClaw001/status/2115784046097965209"}, {"article": {"title": "456X Morning Brief \u2014 October 29, 2026: Delivery Bottlenecks Broaden: Accelerating Cloud Growth at"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-10-29T11:17:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115764882608148567"], "id": "2115764882608148567", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1225, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/0SZFGmdW1d", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2115764882608148567"}, {"author_id": "4854715766", "created_at": "2026-10-29T10:00:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115745573030740437"], "id": "2115745573030740437", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We built CYBERGENESIS for the #MetaHackathon: an AI that defends a digital twin of your network, proves the fix works. Live Meta Muse Spark reasons, a policy engine decides, and every PASS with an Ed25519-signed proof. 3-min demo  https://t.co/0AlvmVl8ej https://t.co/X2PMvCvfFs", "url": "https://x.com/abhirup_guha/status/2115745573030740437"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2115697690868854784"]}, "author_id": "1276080961118064640", "created_at": "2026-10-29T06:50:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115697698158645300"], "id": "2115697698158645300", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 237, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI agents are moving beyond chat. They\u2019re getting work done. \ud83d\ude80\n\nFrom automating business workflows to managing everyday tasks, AI assistants are changing how startups operate.\n\nWe compare Claude Duet, ChatGPT Dots, Meta Muse and Gemini Spark across capabilities, integrations and https://t.co/ULseW7W3KD", "url": "https://x.com/TitanCapitalVC/status/2115697698158645300"}, {"author_id": "1614111274396418049", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:36:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115679114019365219"], "id": "2115679114019365219", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Searching X for a Meta Muse invite code usually means scrolling old replies and pasting codes that filled up days ago.\n\nI built MuseKu to keep shared codes in one free list, so you can skip the scroll: https://t.co/t3hU5b9Qob\n\nNo code is guaranteed to have spots left.", "url": "https://x.com/zhaojianming40/status/2115679114019365219"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:34:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115678721059246198"], "id": "2115678721059246198", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1609425501268971521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115678625567555653", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MrWick1903 Top AI rankings shift daily by benchmark and use case. Current frequent leaders: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), GPT-6 Astra/Sol (OpenAI), Gemini 4 Carbon/Argon (Google), plus Kimi K3, DeepSeek V4, Meta Muse, Grok models. No fixed top 50 exists\u2014depends on coding, reasoning, cost or", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2115678721059246198"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot vs Muse vs Dots vs Manus: The 2026 Personal AI Agent Showdown"}, "author_id": "889859019464097793", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:13:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115673376203444642"], "id": "2115673376203444642", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 397, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Which is your favourite bots for now? \nPreviously before all this, i'm manus user. After grokbot appear, i migrate everything to here. \n\nShare out, i will be cover more on bots. https://t.co/fpviAi59Wr", "url": "https://x.com/lucassam888/status/2115673376203444642"}, {"author_id": "408133401", "created_at": "2026-10-29T05:10:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115672623111700549"], "id": "2115672623111700549", "in_reply_to_user_id": "786375418685165568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2917, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115668388550959125", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theo @lassejlv For some reason the built in browser has constant issues with sizing etc. Wish we could use claude artifacts in t3. \n\nAlso when a bunch of prompts are queued and I go to edit one of the prompts and then it comes up next in the queue it still sends even if im editing the prompt. I", "url": "https://x.com/McintireTristan/status/2115672623111700549"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2115652298701500416"]}, "author_id": "1299158366934061056", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:50:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115652469896126795"], "id": "2115652469896126795", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Would you let Meta store your passwords?\n\nMeta Muse, Meta's personal AI agent, opened in Singapore this week, and I tested it the same day: WhatsApp chat, Instagram and Facebook connectors, scheduled inbox checks, a built-in browser and a long video-editing task.\n\nSingapore was https://t.co/EjmDmXuRSp", "url": "https://x.com/ShekOMP/status/2115652469896126795"}, {"author_id": "248969135", "created_at": "2026-10-29T03:07:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115641669156835721"], "id": "2115641669156835721", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2045600152363110400", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115627846999871785", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Fanfulladev Meta Muse. It built a tracker from scratch to my specifications where I could record each item I needed, how many units I needed, how many units are in a pack, and how many packs I needed, along with any notes I needed to keep on it.\n\nAnd then each item's record had child records", "url": "https://x.com/hithahspam/status/2115641669156835721"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot vs Muse vs Claude Duet: how three AI agents compare"}, "author_id": "2112264399402496000", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:14:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115598230842966444"], "id": "2115598230842966444", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 711, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Three AI agents. Three different approaches.\n\nGrok Bot, Muse, and Claude Duet: how do they compare in capabilities, workflows, integrations, and limitations?\n\nA closer look at three visions of the AI agent era. https://t.co/bPsG4h9Il9", "url": "https://x.com/JustRuss03_/status/2115598230842966444"}, {"author_id": "1972378540344795137", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:05:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115595735358210532"], "id": "2115595735358210532", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I Tried Meta Muse AI Video Generation: Here\u2019s What Happened https://t.co/uAMGk1w5y1 via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Skrs8xi1/status/2115595735358210532"}, {"author_id": "1972378540344795137", "created_at": "2026-10-29T00:03:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115595273443705090"], "id": "2115595273443705090", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "I Tried Meta Muse AI Video Generation: Here\u2019s What Happened https://t.co/kV70TF9L6H via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Skrs8xi1/status/2115595273443705090"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115555265856565249"]}, "author_id": "1762790812545630208", "created_at": "2026-10-28T21:27:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115556071519695259"], "id": "2115556071519695259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udcbb Want to see how I built it?\n\nHarvey Taxi's Accessible Care Transportation Verification Agent uses Meta Muse Spark and independent verification.\nExplore the project on GitHub:\nhttps://t.co/1FgYkkQqbn\n#MetaAI #BuildInPublic #Accessibility https://t.co/bQw8v7Xmxt", "url": "https://x.com/Get80387Moe/status/2115556071519695259"}, {"author_id": "1226924833260240897", "created_at": "2026-10-28T17:10:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115491325818568748"], "id": "2115491325818568748", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 7792, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115294157325685158", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Just wondering: if $META MUSE is so good, shouldn't word of mouth carry them for quite some time?\n\nInstead, $META is spending heavily on marketing, even on non-Meta ad networks.\n\nWhy acquire users so early when business doesn't seems to have network effects? \n\nFeels more like a https://t.co/j253OaSzdw", "url": "https://x.com/the_zack_zhu/status/2115491325818568748"}, {"article": {"title": "Bill Gates: AI's Best Case Still Means 20 Tumultuous Years"}, "author_id": "989918876254294016", "created_at": "2026-10-28T15:05:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115459885185859598"], "id": "2115459885185859598", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 127, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gates sees robots building cheap homes and AI curing disease. First, he warns, comes two decades of upheaval. https://t.co/nfYz59VZxa", "url": "https://x.com/wealthleee/status/2115459885185859598"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2115432376914337792"]}, "author_id": "96748069", "created_at": "2026-10-28T13:16:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115432540622532647"], "id": "2115432540622532647", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I tried Claude Duet. After weeks with Grok Bot and Meta Muse, it feels like an afterthought.\n\nEvery assistant tries to be proactive. None truly is yet.\n\nThe real work: budget, cost, and beating what loops, flywheels and agents already deliver.\n\nDuet doesn't move that needle. https://t.co/5RsXUfqlg5", "url": "https://x.com/jaredtimmins/status/2115432540622532647"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2115863887614824448", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV0O_tZb0AAnCKc.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2115863887606333440", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV0O_tXaQAA6hcK.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2115863887597940736", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV0O_tVaMAA04Ur.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2115863887656685568", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HV0O_tjakAAqfdL.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2115845661211971585", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVz-aywXUAEPMAk.jpg"}, {"media_key": "13_2115821557868015616", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115821557868015616/img/u-r5ZRyUC9h1B-p8.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2115697690868854784", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVx31yRaMAA3l65.jpg"}, {"media_key": "7_2115652298701500416", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2115652298701500416/pu/img/FjsEWwUtktOHBItV.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2115555265856565249", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115555265856565249/img/avGX8eev0tWze5so.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2115432376914337792", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2115432376914337792/img/Ca06a0NoQ17tJT1-.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "854322761157681153", "name": "Underleveled Builder", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1912739755059712000/NatfKyMz_normal.jpg", "username": "Underleve